This project reuses and adapts EcoFlow authentication, MQTT transport, client
ID, and protobuf wire helpers from EcoFlow-PowerGlow-for-Home-Assistant:
https://github.com/Xygen/EcoFlow-PowerGlow-for-Home-Assistant

PowerPulse protocol field research is based in part on ha-ef-ble:
https://github.com/rabits/ha-ef-ble

MQTT frame capture and command-routing design is informed by ecoflow-energy-ha:
https://github.com/shuette42/ecoflow-energy-ha

No ha-ef-ble source code is bundled in this repository at this stage.
